<title>USA: Seagram Co Ltd sets regular dividend.</title>
<headline>Seagram Co Ltd sets regular dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		$0.1650		   $0.1650</p>
<p> Pay		   June 16</p>
<p> Record		 June 2</p>
<p>Note: Dividend shown in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>Shareholders receiving dividends in Canadian funds will be paid based on the Bank of Canada noon rate of exchange on the record date.</p>
